    <bpmn:process id="W_W5289" name="W5289. Temporary Container Sales Office Site Selection and Setup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store tagged Red or Yellow (W5274) with reconstruction timeline &gt; 30 days
Frequency: Per approved temporary site mobilization
Volume: ~1-2 setups annually
Owner: Facilities Coordinator / Store Manager
Participants: Construction Contractor, LP Officer, LGU Permit Officer
Source: workflow W5289 — Temporary Container Sales Office Site Selection and Setup</bpmn:documentation>
